<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fff0f6">
<meta name="description" content="A little birthday surprise made just for you.">
<title>A Special Surprise For You ♡</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,500&family=Sacramento&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

<div class="ambient"></div>
<div class="floating-hearts" id="hearts"></div>

<div class="top-tag">MADE WITH ♡ JUST FOR YOU</div>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section class="intro" id="intro">
  <div class="intro-card">
    <div class="tiny-stars">✦ · ˚ ✧ · ˚</div>
    <div class="gift" id="gift" onclick="openSurprise()">🎁</div>
    <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING FOR YOU</p>
    <h1>Hey, <span>Beautiful!</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">Someone has prepared a little surprise just for you...</p>
    <button class="primary-btn" onclick="openSurprise()">Open Your Surprise ♡</button>
    <div class="bottom-note">psst... today is all about you ✨</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MAIN -->
<main id="main" class="hidden">

<section class="hero section">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="pill">✿ YOUR SPECIAL DAY ✿</span>
    <p class="script">A day as lovely as you</p>
    <h1>Happy Birthday<br><span class="gradient">Beautiful Soul!</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-text">Today, the world celebrates someone who makes it a little more beautiful just by being in it.</p>
    <button class="primary-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('gallery')">Explore Your Surprise ↓</button>
    <div class="sparkle">✧ ♡ ✧</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-art">
    <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
    <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
    <div class="hero-circle">
      <img src="assets/A.jpg" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
      <span class="photo-placeholder">🎀</span>
    </div>
    <span class="deco d1">♡</span>
    <span class="deco d2">✿</span>
    <span class="deco d3">✨</span>
    <span class="deco d4">🦋</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section gallery-section" id="gallery">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="pill">LITTLE MOMENTS</span>
    <h2>A Gallery of <em>Beautiful Memories</em></h2>
    <p>Every picture has a little story. Every moment is special.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="gallery">
    <div class="polaroid rotate-left">
      <img src="assets/A.jpg" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/500x600/ffe0eb/aa6480?text=Your+Photo+1'">
      <span>Simply you ♡</span>
    </div>
    <div class="polaroid rotate-right">
      <img src="assets/C.jpg" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/500x600/f1e3ff/9168aa?text=Your+Photo+2'">
      <span>Pretty moments ✨</span>
    </div>
    <div class="polaroid rotate-left">
      <img src="assets/D.jpg" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/500x600/ffe9d9/bb8168?text=Your+Photo+3'">
      <span>One of a kind 🎀</span>
    </div>
    <div class="polaroid rotate-right">
      <img src="assets/E.jpg" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/500x600/e6efff/7087b5?text=Your+Photo+4'">
      <span>Forever memorable ♡</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="message-section section" id="message">
  <div class="message-card">
    <span class="pill">A NOTE FOR YOU 💌</span>
    <div class="letter-icon">💌</div>
    <h2>Something from <em>the heart...</em></h2>
    <p class="message-text" id="messageText">
      On your special day, I just want you to know how wonderful you are.
      May your smile never fade, your dreams find their wings,
      and your life always be filled with beautiful little moments.
      You deserve all the happiness this world has to offer.
      Keep shining, keep smiling and always be YOU. ♡
    </p>
    <div class="signature">With lots of love ♡</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cake-section section" id="cake">
  <span class="pill">MAKE A WISH ✨</span>
  <h2>One wish. A thousand <em>possibilities.</em></h2>
  <p>Close your eyes, make a wish and blow the candles! 🎂</p>
  <div class="cake" id="cakeArt">
    <div class="flames">
      <span class="flame">🔥</span><span class="flame">🔥</span><span class="flame">🔥</span>
    </div>
    <div class="candles"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="cake-top"></div>
    <div class="cake-layer"></div>
    <div class="cake-bottom"></div>
    <div class="plate"></div>
  </div>
  <button class="primary-btn" onclick="blowCandles()">Blow the Candles 🕯️</button>
  <p id="wishText" class="wish-text"></p>
</section>

<section class="final-section section">
  <div class="final-card">
    <div class="final-stars">✧ ✦ ♡ ✦ ✧</div>
    <p class="script">Once again...</p>
    <h2>Happy Birthday!</h2>
    <p>Never forget how special you are.<br>Keep being your magical self. 🎀</p>
    <button class="primary-btn" onclick="celebrate()">One Last Surprise ♡</button>
    <div class="final-decoration">🌷 🦋 🎀 🌸</div>
  </div>
</section>





<section id="love-special" class="love-special">
  <div class="love-glow"></div>
  <div class="love-content">
    <span class="love-kicker">A LITTLE SOMETHING FROM MY HEART</span>
    <h2>For My <span>Special One</span> ❤️</h2>
    <div class="love-divider">♡ ✨ ♡</div>
    <p class="love-line">Dhanshri... ek baat dil se kehni hai.</p>
    <p>
      Tu kabhi meri life ka ek bahut khoobsurat hissa thi...
      aur sach kahu toh aaj bhi hai. Waqt badla, situations badli,
      lekin mere dil mein tere liye jo feelings hain, woh kabhi kam nahi hui.
    </p>
    <p>
      Aaj bhi main tujhse pehle se bhi zyada pyaar karta hoon.
      Tu mere liye sirf special nahi, balki woh insaan hai
      jise main dil se kabhi khona nahi chahta.
    </p>
    <p>
      Teri smile mere liye bahut matter karti hai.
      Main bas chahta hoon ki tu hamesha khush rahe,
      tere saare dreams poore ho aur teri life hamesha beautiful rahe.
    </p>
    <p class="love-highlight">
      I don't know what the future holds, but one thing is true...
      you will always have a very special place in my heart. ❤️
    </p>
    <div class="love-signature">With lots of love, always... 💗</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="cake-surprise" class="cake-surprise">
  <div class="cake-heading">
    <span>MAKE A WISH, BEAUTIFUL ✨</span>
    <h2>A Cake Made With Love 🎂</h2>
    <p>Close your eyes, make a wish and tap the candles!</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cake-scene">
    <div class="cake-candles">
      <span class="candle"><i></i></span>
      <span class="candle"><i></i></span>
      <span class="candle"><i></i></span>
    </div>
    <div class="cake-top"></div>
    <div class="cake-middle"></div>
    <div class="cake-bottom"></div>
    <div class="cake-plate"></div>
  </div>
  <button class="cake-button" onclick="specialCakeWish()">Blow the candles ✨</button>
  <p id="cake-message">May all your wishes come true, Dhanshri! 💖</p>
</section>

<div id="love-final" class="love-final">
  <div class="final-heart">💗</div>
  <h2>You're My Special One</h2>
  <p>Some feelings are too beautiful to explain in words. Happy Birthday, Dhanshri! ❤️</p>
  <span>Forever wishing happiness for you ✨</span>
</div>

<footer>CRAFTED WITH LOVE & A LITTLE MAGIC ♡</footer>
</main>

<!-- POPUP -->
<div class="popup-overlay" id="popup">
  <div class="popup-box">
    <button class="close" onclick="closePopup()">×</button>
    <div class="popup-emoji">🧸</div>
    <p class="eyebrow">A SPECIAL MESSAGE</p>
    <h2>You're someone's<br><em>favourite person!</em></h2>
    <p>And today, you deserve a little extra magic. Ready?</p>
    <button class="primary-btn" onclick="startExperience()">Let's Celebrate! ♡</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="toast" id="toast">You are magical! ♡</div>
<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
